ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhao Rong and Liu Ming are couples in a long-term love relationship, and Liu Ming gives a lot in this relationship. During a clear weekend outing, Liu Ming carefully prepares Zhao Rong's favorite picnic food and activities.\n\n[Question]\nZhao Rong should feel happy about Liu Ming's thoughtful preparation, but she shows anxiety, why?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhao Rong constantly thinks about the future of their relationship, but Liu Ming never takes further action.\nB. Zhao Rong worries that Liu Ming's work is too busy to maintain such special care for a long time.\nC. Zhao Rong worries that the plan for the outing may get ruined by sudden bad weather.\nD. Zhao Rong is dissatisfied with some of Liu Ming's habits and some of the prepared food, even though he prepares so much.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266818262150577,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e195d6006945d27ffd4d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367893894,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"a77aaadf5b6547fcb8af1c170fcfcf0f"}